==Trivia==
===Origin===
*The standard illustration card features {{p|Cramorant}} in its {{form|Cramorant|Gulping Form}}, while the illustration rare card features Cramorant in its {{form|Cramorant|Gorging Form}}.
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Vivid Voltage|Cramorant|40}} from the {{TCG|Vivid Voltage}} expansion.
*'''Spit-Out Shot''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Shining Fates|Cramorant|28}} from the {{TCG|Shining Fates}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

